materials.text:
以下是目前的完整程式：
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>總複習｜網站專案技術地圖、報價、交付與驗收</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f4f1ea;
      --surface:#fffdf8;
      --surface-2:#ebe6dc;
      --ink:#1f2523;
      --muted:#626b66;
      --line:#d4cec1;
      --accent:#365e52;
      --accent-2:#dbe7df;
      --warm:#8a5b39;
      --warm-bg:#f3e5d8;
      --danger:#8a4541;
      --danger-bg:#f6e5e2;
      --ok:#3e6851;
      --ok-bg:#e4eee7;
      --radius:24px;
      --shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(37,42,39,.07);
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--ink);
      background:var(--bg);
      font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans TC","PingFang TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;
      font-size:18px;
      line-height:1.75;
    }

    button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
    button,a{touch-action:manipulation}
    a{color:inherit}
    button:focus-visible,
    a:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible{
      outline:4px solid rgba(54,94,82,.22);
      outline-offset:3px;
    }

    .wrap{
      width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));
      margin:auto;
    }

    .site-header{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:30;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:24px;
      padding:16px max(20px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));
      background:rgba(244,241,234,.94);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-weight:900;
      font-size:20px;
      letter-spacing:.04em;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      border-radius:14px;
      color:#fff;
      background:var(--accent);
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:8px;
    }

    .nav a{
      padding:8px 11px;
      text-decoration:none;
      border-radius:999px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .nav a:hover{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}

    main{overflow:hidden}

    .hero{
      padding:86px 0 54px;
    }

    .eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      margin:0 0 18px;
      padding:7px 12px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--accent-2);
      color:var(--accent);
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.04em;
    }

    h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}
    h1{
      max-width:900px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
      font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,82px);
      line-height:1.02;
      letter-spacing:-.055em;
    }

    h2{
      margin-bottom:14px;
      font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,50px);
      line-height:1.12;
      letter-spacing:-.035em;
    }

    h3{
      margin-bottom:10px;
      font-size:24px;
      line-height:1.3;
    }

    .lead{
      max-width:820px;
      margin-bottom:32px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:22px;
    }

    .hero-actions,.button-row{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:12px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .btn{
      min-height:52px;
      padding:12px 19px;
      border:1px solid transparent;
      border-radius:14px;
      cursor:pointer;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:850;
      transition:.16s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    .btn.secondary{background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
    .btn.danger{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger);border-color:#e7c6c1}

    .hero-note{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin-top:46px;
    }

    .mini-card{
      padding:22px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;
      background:rgba(255,253,248,.62);
    }

    .mini-card strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:4px;
      font-size:20px;
    }

    .mini-card span{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}

    section{
      padding:68px 0;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(212,206,193,.75);
    }

    .section-head{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:end;
      gap:28px;
      margin-bottom:30px;
    }

    .section-head p{
      max-width:590px;
      margin-bottom:0;
      color:var(--muted);
    }

    .section-index{
      color:var(--accent);
      font-weight:900;
      font-size:16px;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
    }

    .type-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .type-card{
      position:relative;
      min-height:330px;
      padding:24px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      background:var(--surface);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .type-card .number{
      display:inline-grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      margin-bottom:34px;
      border-radius:50%;
      color:var(--accent);
      background:var(--accent-2);
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .level{
      margin:0 0 12px;
      color:var(--accent);
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .risk{
      margin-top:18px;
      padding-top:16px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .panel{
      padding:30px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      background:var(--surface);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .form-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:18px;
    }

    .field{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:8px;
    }

    label{font-weight:800}

    input,select,textarea{
      width:100%;
      min-height:54px;
      padding:12px 14px;
      border:1px solid #bdb7ac;
      border-radius:12px;
      color:var(--ink);
      background:#fff;
      font-size:17px;
    }

    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}

    .full{grid-column:1/-1}

    .status{
      display:none;
      margin-top:18px;
      padding:14px 16px;
      border-radius:12px;
      background:var(--ok-bg);
      color:var(--ok);
      font-weight:800;
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .status.show{display:block}

    .object{
      margin-top:26px;
      padding:20px;
      border-left:5px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius:0 16px 16px 0;
      background:var(--accent-2);
    }

    .object code{
      font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
      font-size:16px;
      white-space:normal;
    }

    .object strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    .quote-layout{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;
      gap:18px;
    }

    .table-wrap{
      overflow-x:auto;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      background:var(--surface);
    }

    table{
      width:100%;
      min-width:720px;
      border-collapse:collapse;
    }

    th,td{
      padding:17px 18px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      text-align:left;
      vertical-align:top;
      font-size:16px;
    }

    th{
      background:var(--surface-2);
      font-weight:900;
    }

    tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}

    .badge{
      display:inline-block;
      padding:5px 10px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:900;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }

    .include{background:var(--ok-bg);color:var(--ok)}
    .exclude{background:var(--danger-bg);color:var(--danger)}
    .extra{background:var(--warm-bg);color:var(--warm)}

    .boundary-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .boundary{
      padding:17px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:var(--bg);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .boundary strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:4px;
    }

    .boundary span{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}

    .delivery-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .delivery-card{
      padding:22px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;
      background:var(--surface);
    }

    .delivery-card .icon{
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:44px;
      height:44px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      border-radius:14px;
      background:var(--surface-2);
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .delivery-card p{
      margin-bottom:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .check-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:10px;
    }

    .check-row{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;
      gap:14px;
      align-items:center;
      padding:17px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:var(--surface);
    }

    .check-row input{
      width:22px;
      height:22px;
      min-height:auto;
      accent-color:var(--accent);
    }

    .check-row strong{display:block}
    .check-row span{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}

    .result{
      min-width:86px;
      text-align:center;
      padding:6px 9px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--surface-2);
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .rule-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:16px;
    }

    .rule{
      padding:24px;
      border-radius:20px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:var(--surface);
    }

    .rule p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0}

    .important{
      margin-top:24px;
      padding:24px;
      border-radius:20px;
      background:#242c29;
      color:#fff;
    }

    .important h3{color:#fff}
    .important p{margin-bottom:0;color:#e4ebe7}

    .summary{
      padding:42px;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:var(--accent);
      color:#fff;
    }

    .summary h2{color:#fff}
    .summary p{color:#e5eee9}
    .summary .btn.secondary{
      background:#fff;
      border-color:#fff;
    }

    .saved-box{
      margin-top:20px;
      padding:18px;
      border:1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      font-size:16px;
    }

    footer{
      padding:44px 0 60px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:16px;
    }

    footer strong{color:var(--ink)}

    @media(max-width:920px){
      .type-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .delivery-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .quote-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .hero-note{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px){
      body{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}
      .wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}

      .site-header{
        position:relative;
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
        padding:18px 14px;
      }

      .nav{
        width:100%;
        flex-wrap:nowrap;
        overflow-x:auto;
        padding-bottom:4px;
      }

      .nav a{
        flex:0 0 auto;
        font-size:16px;
      }

      .hero{padding:58px 0 38px}
      h1{font-size:46px}
      h2{font-size:32px}
      h3{font-size:23px}
      .lead{font-size:20px}
      p,li{font-size:18px}

      section{padding:52px 0}

      .section-head{
        display:block;
        margin-bottom:24px;
      }

      .section-index{margin-bottom:8px}

      .type-grid,
      .rule-grid,
      .form-grid,
      .delivery-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .full{grid-column:auto}

      .type-card{min-height:auto}
      .panel{padding:20px}
      .summary{padding:26px 22px}

      input,select,textarea{font-size:18px}

      .btn,
      .eyebrow,
      .level,
      .risk,
      .mini-card span,
      .boundary span,
      .delivery-card p,
      .check-row span,
      .result,
      .status,
      th,td,
      footer,
      .object code,
      .saved-box{
        font-size:16px;
      }

      .check-row{
        grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;
      }

      .result{
        grid-column:2;
        justify-self:start;
      }
    }

.site-header{position:relative!important}
/* 窄螢幕上的表格保留完整欄位，逐筆閱讀。 */
@media(max-width:640px){
 table{min-width:0!important;width:100%!important} thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)}
 tbody{display:block} tr{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line,#d4cec1);border-radius:16px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:var(--surface,#fffdf8)}
 td{display:block!important;min-width:0!important;width:auto!important;border:0!important;padding:7px 0!important;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:18px!important}
 td[data-label]:before{content:attr(data-label);display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted,#626b66)}
 .table-wrap,.table-scroll{overflow:visible!important} .site-header,header{position:relative!important}
}
@media(max-width:640px){.site-header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.site-nav{gap:12px}.type-grid,.rule-grid,.form-grid,.delivery-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.btn{display:block;width:100%;text-align:center}}
</style>
<!-- K08 readable layout --><style>@media(min-width:900px){header{position:static!important}.quote-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.8fr) minmax(0,1fr)!important;align-items:start}#quote th,#quote td{padding:18px 14px}#quote .panel{padding:26px}}</style><style id="k23b-style">
.textbook-block{max-width:1120px;margin:48px auto;padding:32px;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #d9ddd8;border-radius:20px;color:#1f2825;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7}
.textbook-block h2{font-size:32px;line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 20px}.textbook-block p{margin:16px 0}.textbook-block summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:22px;padding:16px 20px}.textbook-block details{border:1px solid #d9ddd8;border-radius:12px;margin:16px 0;padding:8px}.textbook-block details p{padding:0 20px 16px}.textbook-block button,.textbook-block select{font:inherit;padding:14px 22px;min-height:52px;margin:8px;border:1px solid #1f5b4d;border-radius:10px;background:white;color:#1f2825}.textbook-block .selected{background:#1f5b4d;color:white}.textbook-block .booked{background:#eee;color:#666}.textbook-block code{font-size:18px;word-break:break-word}
@media(max-width:640px){.textbook-block{margin:24px 16px;padding:24px}.textbook-block button,.textbook-block select{max-width:100%;margin:8px 0}}
</style><style id="k23b-layout-fix">h1,h2,h3{text-wrap:balance}.unit-safe{white-space:nowrap}#quoteResponsibility{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto 24px;padding:0 24px}.result{color:#48514c!important}.summary .eyebrow{color:#fff!important;background:transparent!important}.boundary{padding:22px!important}.check-row{padding-right:24px!important} @media(max-width:640px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 48px)!important}.site-header{padding:24px!important}.site-nav{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px!important}.panel{padding:24px!important}}</style></head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">
      <span class="brand-mark">總</span>
      <span>網站製作總複習</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav site-nav" aria-label="主要導覽">
      <a href="#types">技術地圖</a>
      <a href="#interview">需求訪談</a>
      <a href="#quote">報價</a>
      <a href="#delivery">交付</a>
      <a href="#acceptance">驗收</a>
      <a href="#maintenance">維護</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">教學虛構示例 · 單頁網站專案總複習</p>
        <h1>不是先問「網站多少錢」，而是先把邊界說清楚。</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          從網站類型、需求訪談、功能層級，到報價、交付、驗收與維護，
          把一個網站專案真正需要確認的六個模組放在同一張地圖上。
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#types">開始整理專案</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="#acceptance">直接看驗收表</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-note">
          <div class="mini-card">
            <strong>先分類</strong>
            <span>先判斷是形象、作品部署、預約、會員，還是交易平台。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-card">
            <strong>再畫邊界</strong>
            <span>包含、不包含、新增另計，必須在製作之前說清楚。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-card">
            <strong>最後才驗收</strong>
            <span>手機、表單、資料、付款與 SEO 分開檢查，不用一句「做好了」帶過。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="types">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="section-index">01 · WebsiteType</div>
            <h2>五張等級卡：先看你正在做哪一種網站</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            網站類型會直接影響資料、帳號、後端與驗收方式。
            功能越接近「預約、會員、付款與多人協作」，責任邊界就越需要被明確定義。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="type-grid">
          <article class="type-card">
            <div class="number">1</div>
            <p class="level">功能等級 · 基礎</p>
            <h3>形象</h3>
            <p>適合需要說清楚品牌、服務、聯絡方式與核心行動的店家或個人。</p>
            <div class="risk"><strong>主要風險：</strong>資訊過時、聯絡方式失效、手機閱讀不佳。</div>
          </article>

          <article class="type-card">
            <div class="number">2</div>
            <p class="level">功能等級 · 展示＋發布</p>
            <h3>作品與部署</h3>
            <p>適合作品集、活動頁、專案展示，需處理版本、網域與部署網址。</p>
            <div class="risk"><strong>主要風險：</strong>圖片過重、部署權限不清、正式版與舊版混淆。</div>
          </article>

          <article class="type-card">
            <div class="number">3</div>
            <p class="level">功能等級 · 流程</p>
            <h3>預約與排程</h3>
            <p>適合診所、教練、工作室、住宿等，需要選日期、時段與人員的服務。</p>
            <div class="risk"><strong>主要風險：</strong>重複預約、狀態不一致、前端顯示不等於後端鎖位。</div>
          </article>

          <article class="type-card">
            <div class="number">4</div>
            <p class="level">功能等級 · 身分＋資料</p>
            <h3>會員與課程</h3>
            <p>適合登入、課程紀錄、堂數、會員資料與個人化內容。</p>
            <div class="risk"><strong>主要風險：</strong>權限、個資保存、堂數與交易紀錄無法追溯。</div>
          </article>

          <article class="type-card">
            <div class="number">5</div>
            <p class="level">功能等級 · 交易＋平台</p>
            <h3>交易與平台</h3>
            <p>涉及付款、訂單、退款、平台角色或第三方服務整合。</p>
            <div class="risk"><strong>主要風險：</strong>金流通知、訂單一致性、退款與權限責任界線。</div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="object">
          <strong>WebsiteType 物件示例</strong>
          <code>{ 名稱、功能等級、適合業態、風險 }</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="interview">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
